PUDC-24-223

January 6, 2024
RECOMMENDED MOTION:

Move to approve the Holliday Park Preliminary Plat, advancing the Final Plat to the Governing Body with
staff recommended conditions.

APPLICABLE CITY CODE SECTION(S) AND PLANS:

x
UDC 2.1.2 Preliminary Plat Approval
x
